1. This template is for eDMA3 peripheral (per-channel register architecture).

2. The init function should do as below
   function declaration
   {
      insert fsl_edma.template
      insert several fsl_edma_tcd.template (optional, for tcd0~tcd7)
      insert several fsl_edma_start.template
   }

3. Macro definition.
      fsl_edma_tcd.template
          ${CHANNEL}$ must be 0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 or 7, don't add any suffix for the number, say 0U or 1U is not allowed.

      fsl_edma_start.template:
          ${VPREFIX}$_CHn_CSR_INIT_MASK rule:
              For each channel n (0-7), the mask should include the bits to be configured
              in CH_CSR (ERQ, EARQ, EEI, etc.)
